"successive estimates agree to within 0.1 g. Source equations: Sadraey "
"2020, Sec. 2.6 (mission fractions, Breguet range/endurance, Eq. 2.17-2.18), "
"Sec. 2.7 (electric energy budget, Eq. 2.25), Sec. 2.4 (aerodynamic efficiency)."

