# ── Matching diagram ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

msgid "section.matching_diagram.title"
msgstr "Constraint Analysis — Matching Diagram"

msgid "section.matching_diagram.intro_power"
msgstr ""
"The matching diagram maps all performance constraints onto a single "
"plot of Wing Loading $${W/S}$$ versus Power Loading $${W/P}$$. The "
"feasible design region is bounded by the constraint envelope; the design "
"point is selected from within this region — ideally at the intersection "
"that maximises $${W/S}$$ and $${W/P}$$ to minimise wing area and engine "
"size."

msgid "section.matching_diagram.intro_thrust"
msgstr ""
"The matching diagram maps all performance constraints onto a single "
"plot of Wing Loading $${W/S}$$ versus Thrust-to-Weight $${T/W}$$. The "
"feasible design region is bounded by the constraint envelope; the design "
"point is selected from within this region — ideally at the intersection "
"that maximises $${W/S}$$ and $${T/W}$$ to minimise wing area and engine "
"size."

msgid "section.matching_diagram.figure_caption"
msgstr ""
"Matching diagram — performance constraint boundaries and selected "
"design point (★)"

msgid "section.matching_diagram.no_diagram_note"
msgstr "Matching diagram not available — run constraint analysis first."

